{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:50413bc841928b30","name":"Strangle Vines","source":{"id":"source:reference-50413bc841928b30","title":"Strangle Vines","revision":26551,"timestamp":"2025-03-26T06:32:21Z","sha256":"33f71124ea5f17bf9f92209d0b146cca6ecb6815606830c1fd30f505dc8bfb62","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26551","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Strangle%20Vines&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-50413bc841928b30","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["A mass of vines hangs down from the trees, creating a curtain of vegetation that can choke an unwary creature."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Strangle Vines wrap themselves around an unsuspecting victim and often choke the creature to death. Galactic scholars of botany and life sciences cannot agree about why the vines behave in this manner. Strangle Vines inadvertently guard valuable items left behind by their victims, waiting to entrap any creatures that come along later to retrieve the objects.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Strangle Vines Statistics (CL 6)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Keywords:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Natural"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Natural"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Trigger:"]}," A being begins its turn within Strangle Vines.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Attack:"]}," +8 vs ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d6+1 (-1 step on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},")\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Recurrence:"]}," Each round at the start of the target's turn, as long as the target remains within the Strangle Vines.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," for this Hazard:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Endurance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endurance","referenceId":"reference:98c8abf84e23ff3f"}," (DC 27):"]}," If the character is being choked by the Strangle Vines, for 1 round they take only half damage and do not move on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Life Sciences)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Life_Sciences)"}," (DC 22):"]}," The character identifies the Strangle Vines. As a result, the character and their allies gain a +1 circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," against the Strangle Vines."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," If the Hazard's attack roll exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," by 5 or more, the Strangle Vines wrap around the target's neck and begin choking the victim.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
